[{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2701805520","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103639#issuecomment-2701805520","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103639","id":2701805520,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hCkfQ","user":{"login":"lyuma","id":39946030,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjM5OTQ2MDMw","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/39946030?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma","html_url":"https://github.com/lyuma","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/lyuma/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-05T18:54:44Z","updated_at":"2025-03-05T18:54:44Z","body":"The premise is good. I'm worried about changing the `_process_modification()` API in a way that breaks compatibility.\r\n\r\nI might prefer adding a get_delta_time() function on the SkeletonModifier3D base class.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2701805520/reactions","total_count":1,"+1":1,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2701899768","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103639#issuecomment-2701899768","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103639","id":2701899768,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hC7f4","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-05T19:41:36Z","updated_at":"2025-03-05T20:34:18Z","body":"It seems that the only compatibility method for changing virtual functions is `_parse_file()`, which is the only case I have seen in the past. Is this PR the correct way to do it? @dsnopek\r\n\r\nAnother concerning change is that the Modifier's update flag has been made [more strict](https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103639/files#diff-15517aa247c8a98fa4c614038028e6e9d9179e3476c20f3af3fd41816b458611R360-R362). Previously, updates were always triggered when a pose was changed. That is, if the AnimationMixer was Physics and the Skeleton was Idle, updates were probably being made for both. Well, I suppose it should be said that this has been fixed correctly, since I think the previous state was rather erratic. The only concern is whether this change will cause any problems at certain cases. ","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2701899768/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2702431268","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103639#issuecomment-2702431268","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103639","id":2702431268,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6hE9Qk","user":{"login":"wagnerfs","id":106078,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEwNjA3OA==","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/106078?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs","html_url":"https://github.com/wagnerfs","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/wagnerfs/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-03-06T00:46:01Z","updated_at":"2025-03-06T00:46:01Z","body":"I do believe adding delta to process is the correct way to go as nearly all modifications do need that, breaks compatibility for a good reason since most people (me included) fetch a delta manually.\r\n\r\nI'd also personally rename `advance` in skeleton to `advance_modification` or something like that since that's exclusively for bone modifications, doesn't match the Mixer's method but it doesn't quite do the same thing anyway.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2702431268/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2773446962","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103639#issuecomment-2773446962","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103639","id":2773446962,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6lT3Ey","user":{"login":"TokageItLab","id":61938263,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjYxOTM4MjYz","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/61938263?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab","html_url":"https://github.com/TokageItLab","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/TokageItLab/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-02T19:00:55Z","updated_at":"2025-04-02T19:15:11Z","body":"After discussion with @akien-mga, we added the argument as a new method `_process_modification_with_delta(delta)` due to the restriction that we cannot add arguments to the virtual method during Godot4 due to the policy of not allowing GDScript to break compatibility. This makes `_process_modification()` deprecated, but it will continue to be supported.\r\n\r\nThen I expect that both `_process_modification()` and `_process_modification_with_delta(delta)` will be integrated into `_process_modification(delta)` by the converter when Godot 5 launches, so I have noted that in a comment in the code.","author_association":"MEMBER","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2773446962/reactions","total_count":3,"+1":3,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":0,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0},"performed_via_github_app":null,"minimized":null},{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2776005089","html_url":"https://github.com/godotengine/godot/pull/103639#issuecomment-2776005089","issue_url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/103639","id":2776005089,"node_id":"IC_kwDOAO6SJc6ldnnh","user":{"login":"Repiteo","id":17489292,"node_id":"MDQ6VXNlcjE3NDg5Mjky","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githubusercontent.com/u/17489292?v=4","gravatar_id":"","url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo","html_url":"https://github.com/Repiteo","followers_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/followers","following_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/following{/other_user}","gists_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/gists{/gist_id}","starred_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/starred{/owner}{/repo}","subscriptions_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/subscriptions","organizations_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/orgs","repos_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/repos","events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/events{/privacy}","received_events_url":"https://api.github.com/users/Repiteo/received_events","type":"User","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"created_at":"2025-04-03T14:35:26Z","updated_at":"2025-04-03T14:35:26Z","body":"Needs rebase before this can be merged.","author_association":"CONTRIBUTOR","reactions":{"url":"https://api.github.com/repos/godotengine/godot/issues/comments/2776005089/reactions","total_count":0,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hoor